## Flags for the VM that `start`, `daemon` and `eval` run:
## https://www.erlang.org/doc/man/erl.html
## -mode/-name/-sname/-setcookie are configured via env vars (rel/env.sh.eex).

## Erlang distribution listens on 127.0.0.1 only (ADR 0036). Other local
## users still reach loopback, so the per-server cookie is what keeps them out.
-kernel inet_dist_use_interface {127,0,0,1}
